<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Benjamin You Guy.</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Calgon_pigs</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Benjamin You Guy.</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1SRcmXhT2iNnrt7DxnxGq2</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">2 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You’ve Got the Guts Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">“You’ve Got the Guts” was featured in Season 7, Episode 6 “The Quirk-ducers”</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Gene, Jocelyn, Tammy &amp; Zeke]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're going to dinner, we're going to dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1: Gene (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">G</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), Jocelyn (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">J</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), Tammy (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), Tina (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ti</p><p ttm:agent="v1">) &amp; Zeke (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Look at all of these plump and popular turkeys</p><p ttm:agent="v1">G, J &amp; Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: We're gonna make</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Great Thanksgiving dinner guests</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, because we're conventionally attractive turkeys</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Not like that quirky turkey over there</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ti</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Hi</p><p ttm:agent="v1">J</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Ew, don't talk to us</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Yeah, go away, we've been invited</p><p ttm:agent="v1">J &amp; Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: To special dinners as special guests</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus: Gene, Jocelyn, Tammy &amp; Zeke &amp;</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Jocelyn</p><p ttm:agent="v1">]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We're going to dinner, we're going to dinner</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wе're so glad that we're not-not going to dinnеr</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Like that quirky turkey, ew</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2: Tina]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Why can't I be like the other turkeys?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They're all out having fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is it 'cause I'm scrawny and have glasses and rather smallish buns?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">There he is, my crush</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The most handsome pig, what a rush (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Man, oh, man, I dig that pig[Verse 3: Gene (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">G</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), Jocelyn (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">J</p><p ttm:agent="v1">), Tammy (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">) &amp; Zeke (</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1">)]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">G</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: I thought I was a guest, but they just want me for my breast</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Z</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Much to my surprise they're all staring at my thighs</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ta</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: They all look starving and ready for the carving</p><p ttm:agent="v1">G</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Why don't they eat a pig instead?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">J</p><p ttm:agent="v1">: Oh God they're chopping off my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">*Scream*</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 4: Tina]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I used to spend my time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wishing for a plump behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But now those birds with perfect bodies</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Are decapitated hotties</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I wished I was someone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But it takes guts to be yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I've got the guts</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've got the glory</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I like my scrawny stuff and</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm here to tell my story</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I've got the guts, do you have the guts to be yourself?</p></div></body></tt>